norm dir 2013 34 art 1 general obligation is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_Dir2013_34_Art1_GeneralObligation".

norm dir 2013 34 art 1 general obligation is a prescriptive rule.

norm dir 2013 34 art 1 general obligation has the label "Directive 2013/34/EU Article 1(2)(a): General requirements for financial statements".

norm dir 2013 34 art 1 general obligation has the modality obligation.

norm dir 2013 34 art 1 general obligation is derogated by norm dir 2013 34 art 1 a micro entity.

norm dir 2013 34 art 1 general obligation is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_1".


norm dir 2013 34 art 1 a micro entity is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_Dir2013_34_Art1a_MicroEntityDerogation".

norm dir 2013 34 art 1 a micro entity is a prescriptive rule.

norm dir 2013 34 art 1 a micro entity has the label "Directive 2013/34/EU Article 1a: Derogation for micro-entities".

norm dir 2013 34 art 1 a micro entity has the modality permission.

norm dir 2013 34 art 1 a micro entity is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_1a".


norm gdpr art 6 1 a consent is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_GDPR_Art6_1_a_Consent".

norm gdpr art 6 1 a consent is a prescriptive rule.

norm gdpr art 6 1 a consent has the label "GDPR Article 6(1)(a): Lawful basis - Consent".

norm gdpr art 6 1 a consent has the modality permission.

norm gdpr art 6 1 a consent is derogated by norm gdpr art 6 1 b contract performance.

norm gdpr art 6 1 a consent is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2016/679/art_6/par_1/point_a".


norm gdpr art 6 1 b contract performance is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_GDPR_Art6_1_b_ContractPerformance".

norm gdpr art 6 1 b contract performance is a prescriptive rule.

norm gdpr art 6 1 b contract performance has the label "GDPR Article 6(1)(b): Lawful basis - Contract performance".

norm gdpr art 6 1 b contract performance has the modality permission.

norm gdpr art 6 1 b contract performance is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2016/679/art_6/par_1/point_b".

norm gdpr art 6 1 b contract performance has the comment "Article 6(1)(b) substitutes consent as a lawful basis when contract performance is necessary".


norm eu 2019 1242 art 4 co 2 monitoring is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_EU2019_1242_Art4_CO2Monitoring".

norm eu 2019 1242 art 4 co 2 monitoring is a substantive rule.

norm eu 2019 1242 art 4 co 2 monitoring has the label "Regulation (EU) 2019/1242 Article 4: CO₂ monitoring".

norm eu 2019 1242 art 4 co 2 monitoring has the modality obligation.

norm eu 2019 1242 art 4 co 2 monitoring is derogated by norm eu 2019 1242 art 5 4 vehicle derogation.

