norm eu 2019 1242 art 5 4 vehicle derogation is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_EU2019_1242_Art5_4_VehicleDerogation".

norm eu 2019 1242 art 5 4 vehicle derogation is a prescriptive rule.

norm eu 2019 1242 art 5 4 vehicle derogation has the label "Regulation (EU) 2019/1242 Article 5(4): Derogation from monitoring for certain vehicles".

norm eu 2019 1242 art 5 4 vehicle derogation has the modality permission.

norm eu 2019 1242 art 5 4 vehicle derogation is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2019/1242/art_5/par_4".

norm eu 2019 1242 art 5 4 vehicle derogation has the comment "Article 5(4) provides a blocking derogation that suspends the general monitoring obligation for specified vehicle categories".


